{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31039","headline":"秋雨 · 薛能","name":"秋雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宿雨觉才初，亭林忽复徐。\n簇声诸树密，悬滴四檐疎。\n省漏疑方丈，愁炊问斗储。\n步难多入屐，窗浅欲飘书。\n动蠖苍苔静，藏蚕落叶虚。\n吹交来翕习，雷慢歇踌躇。\n滞已妨行路，晴应好荷锄。\n醉楼思蜀客，鯹市想淮鱼。\n径草因缘合，栏花自此除。\n有形皆霢霂，无地不污瀦。\n境晦宜甘寝，风清□退居。\n我魂惊晓簟，邻话喜秋蔬。\n既用功成岁，旋应惨变舒。\n仓箱足可恃，归去傲吾庐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}